琉璃亭」</color>にいます。","nextNodeIds":[10100210]},{"nodeId":10100210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":413338281,"text":"琉璃亭？","nextNodeIds":[10100211]},{"nodeId":10100211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3744957065,"text":"おお、琉璃亭か！聞いたことがあるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[10100212]},{"nodeId":10100212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4167819417,"text":"璃月の料理には「璃菜」と「月菜」の二つの菜系があって、数百年も対立してきてるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[10100213]},{"nodeId":10100213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1441339913,"text":"で、「璃菜」の代表が「琉璃亭」なんだ。オーナーはわざと緋雲の丘に店を構えて、「月菜」を代表する「新月軒」と正面対決してるって話だぜ！","nextNodeIds":[10100214,10100215]},{"nodeId":10100214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":718877257,"text":"パイモンはこんな時に役立つんだね。","nextNodeIds":[10100216]},{"nodeId":10100216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1218264545,"text":"#そう言わずに——とにかく、美味しいものがあるぞ！{NICKNAME}、早く行こうぜ？","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":10100215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1682851161,"text":"タダで食べられると聞いたらすぐ…","nextNodeIds":[10100216]},{"nodeId":10100203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3065881073,"text":"「ファデュイ」に入るつもりはない。","nextNodeIds":[10100204]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[101002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["10235"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1033,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST